<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Dewan Salman falls 1.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Dewan Salman falls 1.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's polyester fibre maker Dewan Salman Fibre Ltd 10-rupee stock fell 0.55 rupee, or 1.23 percent, to 44.20 on profit-taking after sharp gains on speculative buying in the past few trading sessions, dealers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some three million shares changed hands in early trade at the Karachi Stock Exchange, one dealer said.</p>
<p>The stock is likely to fall before the close, the dealer said. -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
